---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout 
  title="Track Car Toys Wholesale Guide 2026: 3D, Magnetic & Dinosaur Sets | TOYFACTORY"
  description="B2B guide for wholesale track car toys. Compare 3D track sets, magnetic levitation cars, and dinosaur storage tracks with factory pricing from $4.38."
  keywords="Track Car Wholesale, 3D Track Car Factory, Magnetic Track Toy, Dinosaur Track Car, Toy Car Importer Guide"
>
  <nav class="bg-dark/95 border-b border-white/5 py-6 sticky top-0 z-50 backdrop-blur-md">
    <div class="max-w-[1600px] mx-auto px-8 flex items-center justify-between">
      <a href="/" class="text-xl font-display font-extrabold tracking-tighter hover:text-gold transition">
        TOY<span class="text-gold">FACTORY</span>
      </a>
      <a href="/blog" class="text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-gray-500 hover:text-white transition flex items-center gap-2">
        <span>&larr;</span> BACK TO BLOG
      </a>
    </div>
  </nav>

  <article class="py-24 md:py-32 px-8 bg-[#0A0A0F] min-h-screen">
    <div class="max-w-[900px] mx-auto">
      <div class="mb-16">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-6">
          <span class="bg-gold/10 text-gold text-[8px] font-bold px-2 py-0.5 uppercase tracking-widest border border-gold/20">Product Guide</span>
          <span class="text-[9px] text-gray-500 uppercase tracking-widest">Aug 6, 2026</span>
          <span class="text-[9px] text-gray-600">· 5 min read</span>
        </div>
        <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-display font-extrabold text-white mb-8 uppercase tracking-tighter leading-[1.1] italic">
          Track Car Toys <span class="text-gold">Wholesale Guide</span> 2026
        </h1>
        <p class="text-gray-400 text-lg leading-relaxed max-w-2xl">
          From 121-piece 3D racing sets to magnetic levitation tracks and dinosaur storage cases, track car toys remain a staple of the global toy market. Here's what wholesale buyers should know before sourcing.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="prose prose-invert prose-lg max-w-none text-gray-300 leading-relaxed space-y-10">

        <p class="text-gray-400 text-lg leading-[1.9]">
          Track car toys combine two of the most reliable toy purchase drivers: <strong class="text-white">cars</strong> and <strong class="text-white">construction play</strong>. While the category's growth is steady rather than explosive, it enjoys exceptional repeat-purchase rates — parents who buy one track set almost always return for compatible expansion packs. For distributors, this means predictable reorder cycles and a loyal end-customer base.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-display font-bold text-white uppercase tracking-tight pt-4">The 4 Track Toy Sub-Types for Wholesale</h2>

        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white uppercase tracking-wide pt-2">1. 3D Building Track Sets</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-400 leading-[1.9]">
          Large-piece-count sets dominate this segment. The <a href="/product/TF211082" class="text-gold hover:text-white transition">TF211082 3D Track Car (121 pcs)</a> (MOQ 60, $20.54/piece) is our flagship — it builds a full 3D racing circuit and is a proven bestseller in European retail. The <a href="/product/TF211091" class="text-gold hover:text-white transition">TF211091 Luxury Stereo Version</a> (MOQ 30, $17.45/piece) offers a premium alternative with lower MOQ for boutique channels.
        </p>

        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white uppercase tracking-wide pt-2">2. Magnetic & Levitation Tracks</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-400 leading-[1.9]">
          The wow-factor sub-category. The <a href="/product/TF208740" class="text-gold hover:text-white transition">TF208740 Orbital Magnetic Levitation Electric</a> (MOQ 35, $24.46/piece) uses magnets to float cars along an orbital track — a social-media-friendly product that commands premium retail pricing. The <a href="/product/TF209512" class="text-gold hover:text-white transition">TF209512 Magnetic Track Car (126 pcs)</a> (MOQ 90, $10.80/piece) offers a high-value mid-tier option.
        </p>

        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white uppercase tracking-wide pt-2">3. Dinosaur Storage Tracks</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-400 leading-[1.9]">
          A dual-function design: the dinosaur serves as both track and storage case — solving the "where do we put the cars" problem parents love. The <a href="/product/TF213426" class="text-gold hover:text-white transition">TF213426 Dinosaur Swallow Track (12 alloy cars)</a> (MOQ 100, $13.38/piece) and <a href="/product/TF213415" class="text-gold hover:text-white transition">TF213415 Storage Dinosaur (6 pull-back cars)</a> (MOQ 180, $4.38/piece) cover mid and entry price points.
        </p>

        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white uppercase tracking-wide pt-2">4. Compact Sliding Tracks</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-400 leading-[1.9]">
          The <a href="/product/TF212344" class="text-gold hover:text-white transition">TF212344 PVC Double Track Sliding Car</a> (MOQ 80, $5.49/piece) is a space-efficient, low-shipping-cost option — ideal for e-commerce sellers targeting compact or travel-friendly toy segments.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-display font-bold text-white uppercase tracking-tight pt-4">Pricing Tiers at a Glance</h2>
        <div class="bg-[#15151A] border border-white/5 p-8 my-8">
          <div class="space-y-4 text-sm">
            <div class="flex justify-between pb-4 border-b border-white/5">
              <span class="text-gray-400">Entry-Level</span>
              <span class="text-white font-bold">$4.38 – $10.80/piece</span>
            </div>
            <div class="flex justify-between pb-4 border-b border-white/5">
              <span class="text-gray-400">Mid-Range</span>
              <span class="text-white font-bold">$13.38 – $17.45/piece</span>
            </div>
            <div class="flex justify-between">
              <span class="text-gray-400">Premium</span>
              <span class="text-white font-bold">$20.54 – $24.46/piece</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-display font-bold text-white uppercase tracking-tight pt-4">Logistics: The Hidden Margin Factor</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-400 leading-[1.9]">
          Track sets ship in large cartons, so CBM efficiency drives your landed cost. Our carton configurations are optimized for container loading — a 20ft container fits 96 cartons of the TF211082 (0.28 CBM each). Always request the full <strong class="text-white">carton dimensions, CBM, and gross/net weight</strong> for each item before calculating your total procurement budget.
        </p>

        <div class="bg-gold/5 border border-gold/20 p-10 mt-16 text-center">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-display font-bold text-white mb-4 uppercase">Source Track Toys at Factory Pricing</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm mb-8">Request our complete track toy catalog with 7 models, tiered pricing, and logistics specs.</p>
          <a href="/#rfq" class="inline-block bg-gold text-dark px-12 py-5 font-bold uppercase text-[10px] tracking-[0.3em] hover:bg-white transition-all">
            Request Track Toy Catalog &rarr;
          </a>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </article>

  <footer class="py-24 border-t border-white/5 bg-[#050508] text-center">
    <div class="flex flex-col items-center gap-6">
      <div class="flex gap-10 text-[9px] text-gray-400 uppercase tracking-[0.4em] font-bold">
        <a href="/privacy" class="hover:text-gold transition">Privacy</a>
        <a href="/terms" class="hover:text-gold transition">Terms</a>
        <a href="/return" class="hover:text-gold transition">Returns</a>
      </div>
      <div class="text-[9px] text-gray-500 uppercase tracking-[0.4em] font-bold italic">
        &copy; 2026 TOYFACTORY Manufacturing. Global B2B Standards.
      </div>
    </div>
  </footer>
</Layout>
